7. Technical Implementation Requirements
 * Stack: Vanilla HTML5, Tailwind CSS via CDN, FontAwesome 6 for icons, and ES6 JavaScript (async/await fetch).
 * Clean Code Structure: Keep frontend JavaScript logic modular (fetchData(), renderKPIs(), renderSVGGraph(), bindNodeClickEvents(), updateDrawer(), openTranscriptModal()).
 * Error Handling: Include fallback states if /data/agent_journey_mock.json fails to load or takes longer to fetch.
